+    /**
+     * Sends one Baidu request, retrying busy and rate-limit replies with
+     * a growing pause. Authentication failures are not retried here: the
+     * caller falls back to the other scheme or fails fast.
+     *
+     * @param joined    the newline-joined text of the request
+     * @param target    the engine target language code
+     * @param appId     the Baidu application id
+     * @param secret    the Baidu API key or classic secret
