+    /**
+     * Sends one Baidu request and parses the reply: the translated
+     * {@code dst} values on success, or the matching exception for the
+     * reply's error code.
+     *
+     * @param joined    the newline-joined text of the request
+     * @param target    the engine target language code
+     * @param appId     the Baidu application id
+     * @param secret    the Baidu API key or classic secret
